# Research Role

Independent research operations only: projects, papers, submissions, reviews, publications, resources, reports. No academic course ops, finance, admin, or system settings.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Research Projects · Research Papers · Researchers · Submissions · Reviews · Publications · Research Resources · Reports · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard

Work Center stats: Researchers, Active Projects, Draft / Submitted / Under Review / Approved / Published papers.
Queues: Pending Reviews, Active Projects, Recent Submissions.

## Workflow

`Project → Paper → Submit → Review → Revision → Approve → Publish`

Researchers cannot approve their own papers. Ownership + RBAC enforced server-side.

## Never manages

Students, Instructors, Courses, Finance, Withdrawals, Roles, Permissions, System Settings, APIs, Email, Storage.
